{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"mechs\": [\n    {\n      \"text\": \"他已经体验过自己能够站稳、主动接受当下，所以现在的不安不再只是茫然，而是清楚地意识到：自己可以决定怎样对待这一刻，却不能决定这一刻会不会一直在。\",\n      \"premise\": \"1–23中曾感到眼前的一切可能留不住；24–65中第一次主动接受当下，体验过自己能够站稳。\",\n      \"members\": [\"c1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"经历过先前的自豪与喜悦，他不再只顾着过去，也发现此刻仍有快乐可以感受。但这份轻松不像先前的自豪那样有分量，而且可能很快过去，所以高兴时也有一点舍不得。\",\n      \"premise\": \"1–23中过去带来了距离感；24–65中曾真实地感到自豪与喜悦。\",\n      \"members\": [\"c2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"先前郑重珍惜让他感到骄傲，也让他疲倦；此刻可以与别人分享快乐，不必独自承担那份郑重，也暂时不用反复想着自己的得失。但先前的心酸没有消失，快乐越鲜活，他越会不经意地感到它正在过去。\",\n      \"premise\": \"24–65中已经体验过郑重珍惜带来的骄傲、不安和疲倦。\",\n      \"members\": [\"c3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"先前已经切实尝过认真生活的喜悦，所以现在不必时时保持那份郑重，也能自然地快活。但刚才那个十分笃定的自己已经成为过去，他在享受轻松时，也察觉到自己的感受不会一直保持原样。\",\n      \"premise\": \"24–65中曾有过明确的底气和充满郑重的喜悦。\",\n      \"members\": [\"c4\"]\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "baec520e-0a3d-4c92-86b9-a96c0984c0f0", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261025T053524504483Z", "elapsed_seconds": 52.641, "completed_utc": "2026-10-25T05:36:17.134121+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ac52074e9c1854e23bdb2fb5ca466fcbff2cc9e3b0e5a1af5e3c6be4eeb231d3", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261025T053524504483Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "ee59bfc2bfc00fe9323fbed1344bd6d8966c151d2caf1fa6d746aef9709a5a7c"}}}
